  map: 0 3 2 1 4 7 6 5 8 11 10 9 12 15 14 13 16 19 18 17 20 23 22 21 24 27 26 25 28 31 30 29
  affine: lane -> A lane xor 0, A's columns (lane bit j goes to) 3 2 4 8 16; rank(I xor A) = 1
