  one shuffle by the index: cost 7
  chosen under rdna2: 1 stage: lane xor 2 where lane & 1 is not 0 (sg_shuffle_xor), cost 5
  proved: the stages composed lane by lane give the map on every one of the 32 lanes (lane l ends with the value of lane g_1(...g_n(l)), by the shuffle's and the select's definitions)
